{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-07",
  "title": "注意卫生",
  "storyCode": "2-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a5a2e1d850f7f361336e7a0076994ec9f039ae39f57f4b15fb1e5ec2936b6512",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "呜唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "她......怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这，这是矿石病发作的征兆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啧，才一星期就......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "矿石病也有急性的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "芙兰卡，你是哪种？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "怎么，关心我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米娅，如果芙兰卡病逝了，我希望能在罗德岛火化她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你很过分哦，雷蛇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "平时老说要传染我的不是你吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "哈，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "急性和慢性之分，具体回答起来有些复杂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但至少，米莎她的情况，非常危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这样下去，在很短的时间内，矿石病就有可能威胁到她的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只能先应急处理一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但对米莎的病情进行控制这件事，刻不容缓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "必须向龙门声明这一点。事件平息之后，我们必须把米莎接回罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这是我们对任务目标的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "她是不是......快爆了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉！疼！为什么要打我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "说话注意点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "如果有一天我快爆了，我一定会努力爬到你身边的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "对不起！芙兰卡小姐！以前多有得罪请原谅我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "先把目标转移到安全的地区吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "顺便，我们后方，发生了些情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们要干什么！！滚出去！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都是感染者，我们不想动粗！别挡路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你已经毁了我们的家，现在还要把近卫局引过来吗！别想过去！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......！不识时务的家伙，快滚开！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别逼我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "（要动手吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "（看来他们是跟丢了。现在动手的话，罗德岛会暴露行踪。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "（会不会干扰到任务进程？如果会，后果有多严重？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "（有一定影响，但——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "（没有那么严重吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那就干吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果条件允许，救助感染者是罗德岛理所当然的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "哼哼，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "果然当初选择跟着你是正确的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那是什么意思......芙兰卡小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "没什么没什么，就是夸夸你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "大概意思是，性格和你很合得来吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你为什么那么懂我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "大概是因为，你可真烦人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "该教训一下这帮为非作歹的家伙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "小心那些会在各个建筑物间跳来跳去的整合运动感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "除此之外，还要记得保全龙门本地的感染者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "难度不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——但，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那就，上吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，要好好指挥我和德克萨斯哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
